Drop-in configuration for trestled.

Every file ending in .conf in this directory is read after
/etc/trestle/trestle.conf, in lexical order. Files use the same INI syntax
([global] and [network:NAME] sections). A later value for a key replaces an
earlier one; nft_rule entries accumulate.

Example: /etc/trestle/conf.d/10-lab.conf

    [network:lab]
    users = @labusers
    subnet = 10.42.0.1/24
    masquerade = yes
    firewall = yes

Check with "trestled -t" and apply with "systemctl reload trestled".
